---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---

<section class="bg-cream text-ink">
	<div class="wrap grid gap-10 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:py-section">
		<h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-tight lg:text-5xl">
			Here&rsquo;s an opportunity on the table.
			<span class="text-ink/40"> Do you already know what security will win you?</span>
		</h2>

		<div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-8 lg:pt-2">
			<p class="max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate">
				If the answer to that question is no: no shame. All of this is new — the
				laws, the geopolitical situation, AI. There IS no best practice yet, and no
				expert who can explain it all. Nobody has done this before.
			</p>
			<a href="#apply" class="btn btn-blue text-sm">
				Apply to join
				<Icon name="arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4" stroke={2} />
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
